1602 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Plettenberg Capital is a software\055driven systematic investment firm built around a fast\054 automated research engine that discovers and evaluates strategies at scale\056 Our platform runs 470\053 independent algorithms across global equities\054 commodities\054 government bonds\054 sector ETFs\054 and select digital assets\056 By mapping how liquidity flows across sectors and regions\054 we position ahead of major shifts rather than reacting to them\056 Breadth is our core robustness\072 hundreds of small\054 uncorrelated edges help avoid crowding and reduce drawdowns during stress\056 The result is a diversified\054 adaptive portfolio engineered to deliver consistent risk\055adjusted returns with low correlation to traditional benchmarks\056)
